  "description": "Migrate data and build integrations between Dataverse / Dynamics 365 environments, SQL Server databases and CSV files. Map columns with formulas, look up values in targets, chain insert / update / upsert / delete steps, preview the result with a dry run and run it on demand. Projects are saved as local files and can also be run without XrmToolBox, from scripts or on a schedule, with the Replisteer command line runner. Sends anonymous usage statistics (no data, names or connection details) when statistics are allowed in the XrmToolBox settings.",
